1
00:00:00,289 --> 00:00:01,869
(Amy:)Doesn't matter. You're out. He's in.

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:04,130
(Amy:)No date to the prom,
two dates to a wedding.

3
00:00:04,293 --> 00:00:06,583
(Amy:)Hmm, how times change.

4
00:00:10,382 --> 00:00:13,222
Ha, ha, you have to go to a wedding.

5
00:00:18,265 --> 00:00:19,305
(Howard(off):)I'll get it.

6
00:00:19,475 --> 00:00:21,935
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Could you get it?
I said I'm getting it!

7
00:00:22,102 --> 00:00:25,352
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Fine, I'll get it.
I got it!

8
00:00:27,232 --> 00:00:28,612
(Howard:)Oh, hi.

9
00:00:28,775 --> 00:00:30,025
(Sheldon:)Hey.

10
00:00:30,235 --> 00:00:31,365
I don't wanna fight.

11
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:35,360
(Bernadette:)I was just surprised when you sprung
the living-with-your-mom stuff on me.

12
00:00:35,824 --> 00:00:39,824
(Howard:)Yeah, well,
I'm sorry I didn't run it by you first.

13
00:00:39,995 --> 00:00:42,625
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)I don't know
who you're talking to, but in or out!

14
00:00:42,789 --> 00:00:45,329
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)We don't need bugs!

15
00:00:46,335 --> 00:00:48,215
(Howard:)The bugs only come here...

16
00:00:48,378 --> 00:00:51,168
(Howard:)...because you're their queen!

17
00:00:53,759 --> 00:00:55,509
Listen, how about this?

18
00:00:55,677 --> 00:00:59,227
Before we make any decision
about where we live, we have a trial run.

